    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第35篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">做 AI 视频的各位读者老师应该都有体感，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在绝大多数AI视频生成还是太太太慢了。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">8月初我就详细测评过OiiOii的视频创作能力（<a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzY0MDM2MTExNQ==&amp;mid=2247485825&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e0b034330537689b496801a855ccd432&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"8月测评文章\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">8月测评文章</a>），整体出片效率和成片稳定性，在同类创作工具里一直属于第一梯队。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近 OiiOii 再一次升级，专门解决这个视频生成慢的问题。最新上线的 Fal H3 Max 和 Turbo 两个极速版本，生成速度比原版 H3 快 10 倍，官方还表示效果绝对不打折扣。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">有日本创作者掐表实测，这生成速度感人不？</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkQpQlfmw1jbMvPULIC47w39NSOy8xm2xJbAg2wu0Bsco8rIo9OO5hbicEibhUYlowOFiczftobHXqWWJ314Moj8M19oa8zISibbWk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5562700964630225\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1244\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003690\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fal Minimax H3 MAX&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于 Minimax H3 开源权重训练优化，吞吐量能达到官方 H3 的35倍。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">5秒 768P 的音视频，3秒左右就能出片，生成速度甚至快过播放本身。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">搭配 OiiOii 的故事链路，最多一次能出40个分镜，一整集短剧做下来，全程用不到1分钟。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这是我今天花3秒制作的视频，各位读者老师感觉如何？</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4679468980447838208\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4679468980447838208\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCkzoVF2ULeYgaxvPJmBhXQMgJ5YA7u0EH9ZaeVGMScabkw3CCyHH7bABnHctekeeYtiaPFaPWliaWAFa6osibDqcTAm0CKF7Gk13Q%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.75\" data-w=\"1344\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">今天就带大家走完整套流程，从单镜头秒出片到整集短剧量产，看看这次升级到底有多猛。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这篇文章应该比市面上大多数付费课程更加干货，想做视频的各位读者老师可以码住～</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"ht