rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmjsV9xmYugYsocpzYz4qPqetq6CULyWtyXxjMpa9qWEQUmkB1LG9nibEDFV00ia2z90iaec9uJrfpsickBsOdYFLlD9w4wUJiaArjw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5367904695164681\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2854\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003697\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二个是 Agent 入口</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，适合批量快速出片。在【发现】页选择 【Agent 】分类下的【视频】创作，直接选定【MiniMax H3 Max】模型，配合故事链路就能批量跑内容。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkvicVIrLHCDraXFGde1esVgXSIbibAyJFS2icl8LhMvOYX6px80AlvHRtTcEIyKzSNnfhASJlH8uhicPybcpzu70wwApU6lGylJkw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.53894297635605\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2876\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003695\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我自己掐表测了好几组，速度表现确实超出预期。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">雨夜武侠打斗的5秒短片，10秒左右就生成完成。人物动作流畅自然，雨夜光影层次细腻，打斗的发力感也很到位，没有常见的肢体错位或者画面卡顿。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4679470367117672449\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4679470367117672449\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCmToN9OH2qF4Iwxa3Zhp3t0NHVoocCLgiclY8iarO9YkVDPYO0VqQ5fbF0XFFubkUiceqQKibzq9E3p9wBibkFAhthibFIudnpPibIiabA%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.75\" data-w=\"1344\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">给各位读者老师看看无剪辑的制作过程，童叟无欺了属于是。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4679470868337754119\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4679470868337754119\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KClNdhL4MGFbJ3fYAzptPbfOM6icj5bwfo2IEB0StWc74aibD9SVJLMNN4R1eVNCMd0ib4ByAnPpW4EjVTRrsSnfkZ48VgWa7Z16vc%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.8666666666666667\" data-w=\"2016\"></iframe></section